14:["$","section",null,{"className":"section","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":["What ","True Spring"," looks like"]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You are the warmest of the springs: golden or peachy skin, hair with honey, strawberry or copper in it, and bright eyes that often read green, aqua or warm hazel. Clear, sunny colours such as coral, marigold, grass green and turquoise make your skin glow, while cool greys and icy pastels leave you looking tired."}]]}]
